    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d449">

                <pb facs="0526" n="466" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg466"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Adee to Mr. Runyon</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-08-12"><hi rendition="#italic">August 12,
                        1895</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Stern’s influential friends here invoke your good offices to have imprisonment
                    changed to money fine. You will do what you can in that direction.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adee</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Acting</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
